    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda bea ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea damanamughuush bea sheedeaba ang'wan gil eaweedeaba muut bea sheeda, damanda eandeewi bugusta fuga siipaleak, nea geandi ghuuta eenda Gebari, hean ghwajaada humng'eeda ak ghaadaayi gidahiimnaan ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweecheanji bea muut bea sheedean, abeeda gweaydeaba muut gil bea giibaleakta Yehoyakini–was sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwahisa ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Esekieli was ashoohoocheanda, was orjeeda Busi, aba jeeda ng'eanyiida fuga Galdayo, aba ghuuta eenda Gebari abeeda geatinda NG'UTAMIIDA gwanda badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaadaay jeameeda adeana siilakghta, leabu wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, ea shamooghooda haw muuchi, nea gwaneaweesa weeshinda meadajeega sean, nea bugusteaba beastida gwanda oormeeda oomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwarina bugustaanyi duguuga uurji diyeanga mideawa eaweegean asang'wan iisidaa ratooda nyaawa gawuurji dea siida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaba nih mideawa gheamamuunat ang'wan, ak gaba nih mideawa meang'i ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeshanga nyaawa ea doobiiweadi nea baneaguuka geeshanga nyaawa gawuurji baneaguuka geeshanga meayda, ak ghameang'meang' ea gawuurji gharinyeanda sisiy muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hing'eadayda meang'eega nyaawa gwanda geatinga siida meadajeega sean asang'wan, nea ang'waneeda nyaawa abeeda gheamamuunatka nyaawa ea meang'eega nyaawa gwasunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak meang'eega nyaawa gwaroonyi sean iiweay ea mwayamwa geat, gaba nih weah ea gawa mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheamamuunatka nyaawa gwandeawa gheamamda uurji dea siida, nea suh asang'waniin gwandeawa gheamamda uurji dea ng'adiida, meatkweeda geatinda dugwa, nea suh asang'waniin gwandeawa gheamamda uurji dea deeda, meatkweeda geatinda ghaadaam, nea suh asang'waniin gwandeawa gheamamda uurji dea rabearda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gheamamuunatka nyaawa ea meang'eega nyaawa abeeda gwaheeli aba heetiyeada, nea meang'eega asiyeenya bea giliwas gwaroonyi sean nea iyeenya gwadukuta saseenuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gaba nih weah mwadi, heeda gasa guroorooda gawa ea heechea gaweay gil nea iiweay ea mwayamwa geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea diyeangiga mideawa eaweegean iising'ula gawuurji rarayga beasta yeat, nea iisidaa gawuurji ng'ushapta beasta, ak beastida inyeessa gwadiyeada nea ghwahiing'aan, aba bugusteaba diyeangiga mideawa eaweegean; nea beastida abeeda ghoabwaay muuchi, ak jeedeaba beastida gwarina dadamandeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyeangiga mideawa eaweegean inyeessa gwasalda gaweay nea gabiigu, iisidaa gawuurji gheaboong'nyeanda dadamandeeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean damanda eang'uleewi diyeangiga mideawa eaweegean, ghaadaayi geeshagi bea mutukwajeanda aba badayda ng'eanyiida, nea gaba nih mida murdeemba nuut bea diyeangiga asang'wan mideawa eaweegean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeshang'su bea mutukuun, ea oormeadaanyi iisidaa gameaji ea nyawiish, nea ang'waneeda nyaawa sean ea gilagi gil, nea iisidaa ea gadiyeadaanyi gawuurji geeshagi mida jeedeaba niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiweay gaweewa meadajeega sean asang'wan nea mwayamwa geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeshangiga bea mutukuun ea hees muuchi nea deamdeameadi, ak gwaneaweesa gheanyanga murdajeega sean asang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea diyeang'su iiweay, eara geeshangiga gaweay nea ghabeawa murdajeega nyaawa, nea diyeang'su iisiitiing'da eara geeshangiga gwadiyeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeda gasa guroorooda gawa, gaweay, ak eara geeshangiga ghang'eatng'eat nea neekeewa saawa, aba gideaba gurooroodeaba diyeang'su mideawa eaweegean gwanda jeedeaba geeshangiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diyeang'su iiweay eara geeshangiga gaweay, iimiinaada eara geeshangiga ghamiinaada, iing'eatng'eat aba ng'eanyi eara geeshangiga ghang'eatng'eat eara saawa, aba gideaba gurooroodeaba diyeangiga mideawa eaweegean gwanda jeedeaba geeshangiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iheengeaba diyeangiga mideawa eaweegean gwanda giduurji humng'eeda, ak ghameang'meang' ea gawuurji giyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba hing'eadayda humng'eeda meang'eega nyaawa ea siitoabiiw, akaleala goofuursa geaw niirja, ak gaba nih mideawa meang'i iyeenya dukuta saseenuuka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida weayeewean, hean ghaayiinyi nyeashta meang'eega nyaawa, nea ghwanyaashta beega saang'a, ak gawuurji nyeashta ASEETA hoauur, ak gawuurji nyeashta lugooda saang'a, iidu nea ghamiinaada gagilip meang'eega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwahidu nyeashta leabu humng'eeda iheenga nyaawa, iidu nea ghamiinaada gagilip meang'eega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea uhuudeaba humng'eedida mida iheenga nyaawaan, abeeda gwanda giduurji hoorgeeda gheambalmeeda, nea oormeadaanyi gameaji ea oomu, nea uhuudeaba hoorgeedida bea gheambalmeedean, gwanda gida ama sidaah gawuurji siida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak heetiyeada bea saseadaanyi ghameang'meang' ea gawuurji gharinyeanda. Ak gawuurji beasta neaweesa meadajeega sean, nea hing'eadayda saseadaanyi gawuurji beasta ak gwaneaweesa weeshinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisidaa gawuurji gidaghuweang'da sheagiitka aba jeeda shamooghuutka damanda roopta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
